{"candidate_identity":"c52f3f7b702f997b1fb66c054d7fa195d50342b3387f038cc5de8bd04de67435","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5b75b02d2d04686877ceb7a10e3d0868b79baf87af2d1326b2d3b6e1dfad1b3e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"71c8a70a82847da4d5d3946487052612e581fcf6edc82203d8c4b4d5262df2d2","logical_entry_identity":"6b0706780bad36f1afea76311bc2d6d0603f8b1a98e66e7dfac7f182120229da","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Invisibility","source_tag":"_t","target":"隐形"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bb4073549c7387a7f1c94542ff13c068a34686aad93c30c3d04e493cc8e9f6f3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"71ca1082003b30bed116894863c445e881bf538cd1b9fd72018011b382c4b997","logical_entry_identity":"68ebd0cba8de1ebbab95a349732ca38c743b4c2922909cfb9441f3b024b013c1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The eyes of the dead bring interesting news to me. Our masters are not what they appear; they are human, simply masquerading as orcs in our presence. I might have suspected this... it is difficult to disguise the basic weakness and frailty of a human soul, even with complex spells. Their goals elude me, yet I sense strange energies in the vicinity of the High Peak - the voices of spirits long departed from this world... some not from this world at all.\n\nBut this is foolishness compared to my current trials. Gorbat remains as obstinate as ever, the dragon-loving, scale-shining buffoon. He thinks that dragons are special, different, not suitable for my craft. I care not for his prattling, I desire the corpses of dragons! Mountains of them! How can his heart not beat a little faster at the prospect of a dracozombie?! The mere thought of it is enough to send delightful shivers down my spine...","source_tag":"_t","target":"死者之眼为我带来了有趣的消息。我们的主人并非表面那样；他们是人类，只不过在我们面前伪装成兽人罢了。我早该有所怀疑……即便用上复杂的法术，也难以掩饰人类灵魂根本上的软弱与脆弱。他们的目标让我捉摸不透，但我能感受到巅峰附近奇异的能量——那是久已离开这个世界的亡魂之声……有些甚至根本不属于这个世界。\n\n但与我眼下的困境相比，这不过是些无足轻重的小事。加伯特依旧顽固不化，那个爱龙成痴、披鳞炫耀的小丑。他以为巨龙有多么特殊、与众不同，不适合用作我的秘术原料。我才不管他的唠叨，我渴望的是巨龙的尸体！堆积如山的龙尸！想到将能创造出尸龙，他的心跳怎能不加快几分？！仅仅是想象一下，就足以让我感到一阵愉悦的战栗……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fd0ccde21e0fe384069090e91d43a97b71831f5526917eee33f8c63fa45e27e0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"71d98443b54d1c6dd42cd7be4bcae445b067e9f1aaefa0902bb0d9261ba11533","logical_entry_identity":"0cf7fbd23e3d7828c521efa2e360e5f63c2f398e3a99d0c34eaa6bc13a83c1dd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"While this ability is active, you will continually call up to %d level %d shadows to aid you in battle. Shadows are weak combatants that can: Use Arcane Reconstruction to heal themselves (level %d), Blindside their opponents (level %d), and Phase Door from place to place.\n\t\tShadows ignore %d%% of the damage dealt to them by their master.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"维持此技能时，你会不断召唤最多 %d 个等级为 %d 的阴影协助战斗。阴影是脆弱的战士，可以使用奥术重组治疗自己（等级 %d）、使用背后偷袭攻击敌人（等级 %d），以及使用相位之门移动。\n\t\t主人对阴影造成的伤害降低 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7f8c718cf18e594929cdeac781a5dff28383a06ab58d2905dd0e59b849f92de4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"71dc6eae43e8ebddb66fa88c55ae0fcdbe79ad1227d00674fedf33b3d06a1b09","logical_entry_identity":"139433e6a0b2da23177aca575d5c2382d8ddee5249c83d4b5acbcfb589b4da62","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"dream seed","source_tag":"entity name","target":"梦境之种"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a982b247e034a8695ede035f1a440ae970df8ecda46f1e95beff41abe1d8ad04","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"71dcc153b6c17dfff934e0a6e73fa3e71d4aafefe586c684bddca31949d1a69c","logical_entry_identity":"ddc208fb40871ce45969d9e02d9e98062ca3ad2eb0cc925b678a20f1aa0f1494","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"race","source_tag":"talent category","target":"种族技能"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"81f6dcbc3a8570408e01741058bf149c152041d8634f4f7d68f690505a0b7575","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"71dfb353e159f2146dc2b427f2da1d48eb491ce4f8c96f4a341e7f4d7c188fde"